Acts 28:1 , Paul, after his shipwreck, is kindly entertained of the barbarians;
Acts 28:5 , The viper on his hand hurts him not;
Acts 28:8 , He heals many diseases in the island;
Acts 28:11 , They depart towards Rome;
Acts 28:17 , He declares to the Jews the cause of his coming;
Acts 28:24 , After his preaching some were persuaded, and some believed not;
Acts 28:30 , Yet he preaches there two years.
